@startuml
actor User
participant "CRM client" as Client
participant "Password login" as Login
participant "Google account link" as Link
database "SQL Server" as Database

note over Client: Google sign-in returned linkRequired
User -> Client: Sign in with existing CRM credentials
Client -> Login: POST /api/auth/login
Login --> Client: CRM access token
User -> Client: Confirm account linking
Client -> Link: POST /api/auth/google/link\nCRM bearer token and continuation token
Link -> Database: Find valid continuation for JWT subject
Link -> Database: Verify active account and matching email
Link -> Database: Delete continuation and insert account link
Database --> Link: Transaction committed
Link --> Client: 204 No Content
@enduml
